      <node id="n1072">
        <data key="d0">Kot Pack</data>
        <data key="k0">other</data>
        <data key="k1">Container</data>
        <data key="k2">Container</data>
        <data key="k3">https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Kot_Pack</data>
        <data key="k4">14154</data>
        <data key="k5">1.0</data>
        <data key="k6">99</data>
        <data key="k9">To say that a Kot Pack is the belongings of a single KotHaar is something of a misrepresentation. You&apos;re actually holding the belongings of dozens of KotHaar, stretching back millennia. A KotHaar will carry the obsidian of their ancestors, which was reconstituted from their ancestors before them. The Kot Pack is a lineage, an ancestral record of the creature you killed. It puts things a little into perspective, and I&apos;m sure you will treat it with the respect it deserves.</data>
        <data key="k11">https://rudeboy.dev/dragonwilds-crafting-atlas/icons/Kot_Pack.png_8502d</data>
